    SQLite, queue, polling, and proxy health.

scripts/event-health.mjs

    Event bus and active-consumer health.

scripts/codex-smoke.mjs

    Real Codex sample request.

scripts/runtime-smoke.mjs

    Runtime discovery and real sample request through the selected adapter.

scripts/backup-smoke.mjs

    Read-only integrity and schema check of the latest rolling SQLite backup.

scripts/check-python.mjs

    Python helper dependency check.

src/index.mjs

    Main message bridge, workflow execution, AI runtime calls, Feishu actions,
    and response delivery.

src/ai-runtime.mjs

    Local runtime discovery, provider selection, safe command construction, and
    unified bounded execution for Codex, Qoder, and CodeBuddy.

src/mutation-execution.mjs

    Persistent at-most-once journal for confirmed external mutations and crash
    recovery.

src/database-backup.mjs

    Online SQLite backup, independent integrity verification, restrictive file
    permissions, and rolling retention.

src/polling.mjs

    Message search arguments, filtering, normalization, retry delay, and poll
    window behavior.

src/state.mjs

    SQLite inbox, conversation memory, audit records, rate limiting, recovery,
    and retention.

src/reliability.mjs

    Configuration bounds, message validation, health evaluation, and mutation
    authorization.

src/process-runner.mjs

    Child-process timeouts, bounded output, completion detection, and shutdown.

src/media-context.mjs

    Recent image and file reference matching with sender and time isolation.

src/dashboard-server.mjs

    Local watchdog, status API, static dashboard, restart action, and desktop
    notifications.

src/artifact_writer.py

    DOCX generation.

src/extract_file_text.py

    PDF, DOCX, and text extraction.

templates/

    Safe starting templates for Persona and Bible configuration.

config.example.json

    Non-secret configuration example.

knowledge-catalog.json

    Approved Feishu knowledge catalog.

requirements.txt

    Pinned Python dependencies.

package.json

    Node.js dependencies and operational commands.


